\[LS_{+-}(\mbox{corrected})=\sqrt{LS_{++}LS_{--}}\frac{ME_{+-}}{\sqrt{ME_{++}ME_{--}}}, \tag{7.3}\]

where the notations are similar as in Eq. 7.1. Similarly, for anti-matter atoms, the corrected like-sign background is:

\[LS_{-+}(\mbox{corrected})=\sqrt{LS_{++}LS_{--}}\frac{ME_{-+}}{\sqrt{ME_{++}ME_{-- }}}. \tag{7.4}\]

